When the reviewed candidate is a compressed prompt or lightweight variant:
- keep `coverage regression` explicit rather than implied
- keep `host-runtime carryover` explicit rather than implied
- do not approve on brevity gain alone when either surface is weak
- substrate-readiness carryover gate
- lifecycle auditability gate
- topology taxonomy coverage gate
- resource-switching parity gate
- coding-briefing carryover gate
